    "summary": "The user expresses extreme identity crisis and worthlessness following a professional failure, hinting at a desire to be remembered as their \"perfect\" self rather than their current \"pathetic\" self. The assistant attempts to provide empathetic, supportive reframing to decouple the user's value from their achievements. The conversation ends with the assistant repeating a previous response verbatim.",
